Gal is 6 years old and communicates via AAC. He has strong interests in facts, drawing, music, science (especially hands-on exploration, experiments, how things work, chemistry, weather), farm games, space topics (stars, moon, planets, rockets, astronauts), and programming (Code blocks, Games, Robots).

